  "steps": [
    "Pressure cook the mutton with the water, salt, half the ginger and garlic and pepper until tender, about 5 whistles.",
    "Heat the coconut oil in a pan and add the cinnamon, cloves, cardamom and curry leaves.",
    "Add the onion, remaining ginger, garlic and green chillies and sauté until soft but not coloured.",
    "Add the potato and carrot with the cooked mutton and its stock and simmer 12 minutes until the vegetables are tender.",
    "Pour in the coconut milk and warm through on low heat for 5 minutes without boiling.",
    "Adjust the salt and rest for 5 minutes before serving."
